Task: Update LevelManager to accept a BiomeConfig and generate levels based on biome-specific tiles and spawn rules.
Changes:
- Updated MapSystem to support BiomeConfig and biome-specific colors.
- Refactored MapGenerator to accept wall probability and iterations from BiomeConfig.
- Updated EnemySpawnSystem to use biome-specific enemy pools and safe zone logic.
- Added GOBLIN and SLIME support to EnemyRace and EnemySpawnSystem.
- Introduced PersistentTag and LocalLevelTag for entity lifecycle management.
- Tagged Player as Persistent; tagged enemies, projectiles, items, and effects as Local.
- Added LevelManagerTest to verify biome loading.
